review-stage/codex_review_r2_raw.out:45:   Conclusion: middle-mass contributes but is not sufficient (v6-BIN loses 2.2pp, v8-SOFT gains only 0.13pp, RANDOM hurts). The ensemble gain requires (signal) + (middle-mass) + (error-complementarity).
