review-stage/codex_review_r2_raw.out:1269:   - Direct VLM: macro AUROC 0.7684
review-stage/codex_review_r2_raw.out:1271:   - **v6 + Direct ensemble (0.5/0.5): 0.8136 (+4.53pp, 95% CI [+2.82, +6.31], p<0.001)**
review-stage/codex_review_r2_raw.out:1272:   - v8 refutation agent + Direct (0.6/0.4): 0.7812 (+1.28pp, p=0.038)
review-stage/codex_review_r2_raw.out:1273:   - Triple blend 0.5 Direct + 0.1 v6 + 0.4 v8: 0.8036 (+3.52pp)
review-stage/codex_review_r2_raw.out:1276:   - Direct: 0.8153
review-stage/codex_review_r2_raw.out:1278:   - v8 refutation: 0.7731 (-4.2pp)
