review-stage/codex_review_r1_raw.out:96:- Is the v8 refutation agent a novel, defensible contribution?
review-stage/codex_review_r1_raw.out:99:- Are the claims appropriately hedged given the experimental limitations (GPT test broken, v8 test smaller gain than dev)?
